WEBVTT

00:00:02.810 --> 00:00:05.110
What happened to your body?

00:00:05.360 --> 00:00:08.740
But it's you, Grandpa. You're alive!

00:00:09.150 --> 00:00:10.950
Don't move, Sadayoshi!

00:00:13.240 --> 00:00:14.910
How loathsome.

00:00:15.070 --> 00:00:20.580
The more you look and act like Masaru,
the angrier it makes me.

00:00:20.960 --> 00:00:22.370
But I am Masaru!

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:27.050
You fooled me for a long time
even after you became my son.

00:00:27.550 --> 00:00:30.010
I realized too late.

00:00:30.340 --> 00:00:33.260
Dad hasn't taken control of my brain!

00:00:33.430 --> 00:00:39.060
When I realized what sins you were up to,
I wanted to at least save poor Masaru.

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:42.390
But to no avail.

00:00:42.940 --> 00:00:45.770
I shall ask you two questions.

00:00:46.650 --> 00:00:52.070
The first one being, have you found
the soft stone, Sadayoshi?

00:00:52.780 --> 00:00:55.410
Let it bloom or let it wither

00:00:55.570 --> 00:00:58.490
The setting sun ignites the horizon

00:00:58.660 --> 00:01:02.460
And the gears turn

00:01:13.130 --> 00:01:15.930
When the horn blows, the flames dance

00:01:16.140 --> 00:01:18.720
The story waits for no-one

00:01:18.890 --> 00:01:21.640
Off they go, the gears are churning

00:01:21.930 --> 00:01:25.140
A red past chases after you

00:01:25.440 --> 00:01:27.440
The jester's smile

00:01:27.610 --> 00:01:30.320
What's behind the mask?

00:01:30.480 --> 00:01:33.190
You can't erase the scars

00:01:33.360 --> 00:01:35.990
No matter how they burn

00:01:36.240 --> 00:01:38.910
Let it bloom or let it wither

00:01:39.120 --> 00:01:41.910
The setting sun ignites the horizon

00:01:42.080 --> 00:01:47.630
Alone in the depths of the night

00:01:47.790 --> 00:01:51.840
Let out a cry that can cut through fate

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:54.380
That's the cue to begin

00:01:54.550 --> 00:01:58.010
The curtain is rising, it's time to dance

00:01:58.260 --> 00:02:02.010
Everybody sheds tears at the end

00:02:02.180 --> 00:02:05.020
So hold them in now and keep going

00:02:05.180 --> 00:02:09.690
Until the day the curtain falls

00:02:09.860 --> 00:02:15.110
The gears will keep turning

00:02:23.200 --> 00:02:25.460
#16 Encounter

00:02:25.620 --> 00:02:28.750
What's a soft stone?
I don't know what it is.

00:02:28.920 --> 00:02:30.460
I knew you'd say that.

00:02:31.420 --> 00:02:35.260
By repeatedly downloading your memory
and soul,

00:02:35.420 --> 00:02:39.340
you've become able to live on forever
in others' bodies.

00:02:39.550 --> 00:02:43.060
Yet, you still want the soft stone
more than anything.

00:02:46.520 --> 00:02:49.480
Let me tell you where it is then.

00:02:49.650 --> 00:02:51.940
Along with all I experienced.

00:02:52.690 --> 00:02:56.190
I was wrong in trying to just kill you.

00:02:56.900 --> 00:03:00.910
You should be killed only after
you witness the harm you have caused.

00:03:01.370 --> 00:03:05.790
And when you have done so,
I will ask you the next question.

00:03:06.410 --> 00:03:09.920
To see what is going through
your mind at that moment.

00:03:10.370 --> 00:03:11.670
W-What is that?

00:03:12.290 --> 00:03:16.920
It is my blood.
My memories are dissolved in it.

00:03:19.180 --> 00:03:20.680
Drink that blood.

00:03:21.680 --> 00:03:25.220
And experience for yourself
all that I went through.

00:03:35.020 --> 00:03:36.650
Inside of me...

00:03:38.150 --> 00:03:42.490
Grandpa's memories... They're flowing in.

00:03:42.660 --> 00:03:44.780
"MIURA DOJO"

00:03:44.950 --> 00:03:48.910
I... I...

00:03:59.050 --> 00:04:00.220
Stop!

00:04:00.550 --> 00:04:02.840
Good work, Shoji.

00:04:03.260 --> 00:04:06.060
Come to the back.
Yae will make you some tea.

00:04:06.220 --> 00:04:08.060
Yes, sir.

00:04:08.640 --> 00:04:12.810
Master wants you to marry Yae
and take over the dojo.

00:04:13.020 --> 00:04:15.980
But I'm no good with women.

00:04:16.150 --> 00:04:17.860
Excuse me, where's the doc?

00:04:18.480 --> 00:04:20.240
My master has fallen sick.

00:04:20.860 --> 00:04:21.950
Master!

00:04:23.240 --> 00:04:26.700
Forgive me, but duty calls so I must go.

00:04:26.910 --> 00:04:28.160
Yes, go.

00:04:31.120 --> 00:04:37.300
I was learning swordsmanship at Nagasaki's
best dojo while working as a doctor.

00:04:38.300 --> 00:04:41.630
Dr. Bai Yin was the man
who taught me medicine.

00:04:43.180 --> 00:04:44.590
I was a child then...

00:04:47.430 --> 00:04:51.980
Take the medicine twice a day.
Use clean cloths.

00:04:52.140 --> 00:04:54.020
Oh, thank you.

00:04:54.650 --> 00:04:56.560
What an amazing doctor.

00:04:56.730 --> 00:04:58.900
He came from a faraway country.

00:04:59.070 --> 00:05:02.780
I heard he can speak Japanese already.
He sure is smart.

00:05:03.110 --> 00:05:05.950
Wow, what kind of magic is that?

00:05:07.870 --> 00:05:09.160
What's your name, boy?

00:05:09.870 --> 00:05:11.040
Shoji.

00:05:11.200 --> 00:05:12.160
Hey!

00:05:12.500 --> 00:05:14.920
How dare you talk to Dr. Yin like that!

00:05:17.840 --> 00:05:22.090
What have you done!
Those are his precious tools.

00:05:22.800 --> 00:05:23.670
Stand up!

00:05:23.840 --> 00:05:25.050
Wait a minute.

00:05:27.050 --> 00:05:29.310
Tools and medicines are not human.

00:05:29.470 --> 00:05:34.940
What sense is there in harming a human
for breaking a healer's tools?

00:05:35.900 --> 00:05:41.860
If you must make him take responsibility,
take my head first.

00:05:47.280 --> 00:05:48.370
Dr. Yin!

00:05:49.780 --> 00:05:53.660
And so, I became Dr. Yin's apprentice.

00:05:54.710 --> 00:05:59.000
Dr. Yin taught me many things
besides just medicine.

00:06:02.170 --> 00:06:04.590
I've never seen anything like this before.

00:06:04.760 --> 00:06:07.130
Look carefully, Shoji.

00:06:07.300 --> 00:06:09.800
That is what the world is.

00:06:10.890 --> 00:06:15.810
A new world was opened up to me
thanks to Dr. Yin.

00:06:16.600 --> 00:06:18.400
Whoa, a puppet?

00:06:19.270 --> 00:06:20.860
It's not finished yet?

00:06:22.230 --> 00:06:26.280
It was an old dream of mine to make it.

00:06:26.450 --> 00:06:27.610
Not going to finish it?

00:06:29.240 --> 00:06:33.330
Let's finish it together then.

00:06:35.410 --> 00:06:38.000
This is my name, "Bai Yin."

00:06:40.210 --> 00:06:44.210
This is how you'd read your name
in Japanese.

00:06:45.380 --> 00:06:47.430
Shirogane.

00:06:48.130 --> 00:06:50.300
Shirogane, huh?

00:06:58.810 --> 00:07:01.360
So this is the famous pleasure district.

00:07:01.560 --> 00:07:02.900
This way, Doc.

00:07:07.070 --> 00:07:08.530
You'll be fine now.

00:07:09.240 --> 00:07:11.660
How do you feel? Can you get up?

00:07:12.620 --> 00:07:14.700
Thank you for everything.

00:07:14.950 --> 00:07:18.580
The heart stops willing to try
as you grow older.

00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:21.170
Just take it easy for a while.

00:07:21.630 --> 00:07:24.170
Oh, and don't play around too much now.

00:07:25.380 --> 00:07:26.510
Can't help it.

00:07:27.760 --> 00:07:31.890
I will make the medicine,
so if you'll find these ingredients.

00:07:33.350 --> 00:07:35.140
Excuse me.

00:07:40.980 --> 00:07:42.560
How beautiful...

00:07:43.110 --> 00:07:46.030
Tohno-dayu, you came.

00:07:46.730 --> 00:07:48.440
May I see that?

00:07:48.780 --> 00:07:50.200
Of course.

00:07:53.200 --> 00:07:58.330
Head clerk, you don't need to find
the second one, the red gentian root.

00:08:00.660 --> 00:08:02.420
May I ask why?

00:08:02.710 --> 00:08:07.130
I hear it's used often
for swollen lymph nodes.

00:08:07.300 --> 00:08:10.880
But it takes time for the body to absorb
and doesn't do much.

00:08:11.760 --> 00:08:15.390
I could prepare
an even better medicine for you.

00:08:15.600 --> 00:08:17.930
Don't be like that now.

00:08:18.270 --> 00:08:20.100
You're shaming the poor doctor.

00:08:20.680 --> 00:08:24.100
What is shame when it comes
to helping others?

00:08:24.560 --> 00:08:26.190
Am I right, Doctor?

00:08:27.360 --> 00:08:28.780
You're right.

00:08:28.940 --> 00:08:30.320
What's with this woman?

00:08:30.570 --> 00:08:34.110
Now, I have other guests to attend to.

00:08:37.120 --> 00:08:39.790
-Forgive me, Doctor.
-Oh, don't worry about it.

00:08:39.950 --> 00:08:42.370
I apologize for her rudeness.

00:08:43.000 --> 00:08:45.790
Do raise your head,
I really don't mind it.

00:08:46.960 --> 00:08:48.460
But what is she?

00:08:49.170 --> 00:08:52.630
Her knowledge of medicine is incredible.

00:08:53.800 --> 00:08:57.470
I shall tell you then.
You and I go back a long way.

00:08:57.680 --> 00:09:00.060
I know you can keep a secret.

00:09:01.140 --> 00:09:05.060
People call her
the other-worldly courtesan.

00:09:06.360 --> 00:09:07.820
Can you guess why?

00:09:08.150 --> 00:09:09.400
No.

00:09:09.570 --> 00:09:11.570
She is not from this land.

00:09:12.780 --> 00:09:15.240
Her name is Angelina.

00:09:16.490 --> 00:09:20.330
About a year ago,
as I was on my way home...

00:09:20.490 --> 00:09:22.910
I had another attack.

00:09:28.540 --> 00:09:31.920
I thought my time was up.

00:09:42.930 --> 00:09:45.190
She was like a heavenly maiden.

00:09:47.230 --> 00:09:50.690
She saved my life.

00:09:51.360 --> 00:09:53.440
But what really surprised me was...

00:09:54.190 --> 00:09:57.160
she volunteered to be a lady of pleasure.

00:10:01.950 --> 00:10:05.250
It's been a year
since I made it to this country.

00:10:05.710 --> 00:10:08.880
The number of countries
I have hitherto traveled.

00:10:09.840 --> 00:10:12.210
Ever since that day...

00:10:14.670 --> 00:10:17.970
Now, go wherever you wish, Angelina.

00:10:19.550 --> 00:10:21.220
Why so suddenly?

00:10:21.680 --> 00:10:26.310
How am I to live away from here,
away from my people?

00:10:26.480 --> 00:10:28.730
Take this with you.

00:10:30.020 --> 00:10:32.230
Aqua Vitae?

00:10:32.400 --> 00:10:34.740
Have somebody drink it.

00:10:35.360 --> 00:10:38.740
A man who will spend
his eternity with you.

00:10:39.570 --> 00:10:44.160
Shiroganes use their whole lives
to destroy automata.

00:10:44.620 --> 00:10:48.000
But what if you could spend that time
on something else?

00:10:49.460 --> 00:10:53.170
Then there may be some meaning
to this cursed body.

00:10:53.590 --> 00:10:56.130
I haven't a clue what you mean.

00:10:56.800 --> 00:11:00.300
What are you telling me to do, Teacher?

00:11:01.350 --> 00:11:03.010
Mother!

00:11:04.470 --> 00:11:08.140
I knew not for what to live
after that day.

00:11:09.480 --> 00:11:14.150
How can a shirogane live
without its purpose?

00:11:15.320 --> 00:11:17.950
That woman gets on my nerves!

00:11:18.110 --> 00:11:21.120
I don't want to see her face ever again.

00:11:21.280 --> 00:11:22.160
Wait, that room...

00:11:26.700 --> 00:11:28.710
Sorry, wrong room.

00:11:28.870 --> 00:11:30.170
Wait a minute.

00:11:30.460 --> 00:11:31.670
Sir.

00:11:31.960 --> 00:11:34.630
Have we ever met before?

00:11:35.130 --> 00:11:37.090
Huh? Don't think so.

00:11:37.300 --> 00:11:40.970
I'm a poor doctor.
Don't have no money for you people.

00:11:41.220 --> 00:11:42.760
Well then.

00:11:43.180 --> 00:11:46.060
But could you come here for a second?

00:11:46.220 --> 00:11:48.520
Why? I'm leaving now.

00:11:48.680 --> 00:11:53.400
Is Nagasaki's best doctor
afraid of a girl like me?

00:11:55.270 --> 00:11:57.400
Fine, just for a second.

00:12:05.120 --> 00:12:08.160
It's not that this man interested me.

00:12:08.950 --> 00:12:13.920
I had lost interest in everything.
I hoped for nothing.

00:12:15.130 --> 00:12:18.670
I couldn't even die
with this immortal body.

00:12:19.920 --> 00:12:24.760
I could only walk a long dark path
all on my own.

00:12:26.060 --> 00:12:27.100
Alone.

00:12:27.260 --> 00:12:28.680
Help me...

00:12:29.390 --> 00:12:30.560
Alone...

00:12:30.890 --> 00:12:32.020
Help me...

00:12:33.350 --> 00:12:34.440
Alone...

00:12:34.610 --> 00:12:37.690
Somebody help me!

00:12:41.530 --> 00:12:43.820
There's something with your smile.

00:12:45.070 --> 00:12:46.330
It's too pretty.

00:12:48.580 --> 00:12:51.370
Like a doll carved out of wood.

00:12:55.330 --> 00:12:59.670
That's right.
I was just a doll that destroyed automata.

00:13:00.130 --> 00:13:05.140
And now, I've lost even that purpose
and just drag this immortal body around.

00:13:05.300 --> 00:13:07.300
Of course I'm not human!

00:13:07.470 --> 00:13:09.890
How dare this man...!

00:13:10.350 --> 00:13:12.520
You know nothing about me!

00:13:12.850 --> 00:13:13.770
Wait!

00:13:14.480 --> 00:13:16.440
Tell me one thing.

00:13:16.610 --> 00:13:17.520
What?

00:13:18.150 --> 00:13:23.200
What would you do
if you had an immortal body?

00:13:24.700 --> 00:13:28.200
All the men to whom
I've asked this question...

00:13:28.830 --> 00:13:31.910
Not one could give me
a satisfactory answer.

00:13:33.080 --> 00:13:36.790
Even with his big mouth,
this man will be no different.

00:13:37.920 --> 00:13:39.040
Immortal, you say?

00:13:41.670 --> 00:13:42.800
Sounds nice.

00:13:43.760 --> 00:13:47.050
Then I'd be able
to fall in love with a girl.

00:13:49.720 --> 00:13:53.810
Love just one girl for all eternity.

00:13:56.440 --> 00:13:59.310
Just... one girl?

00:14:02.610 --> 00:14:03.900
It's a fire!

00:14:05.030 --> 00:14:06.950
Tohno-dayu, Doctor, you gotta run!

00:14:07.490 --> 00:14:12.080
A samurai tried to force a courtesan
to die with him and started a fire!

00:14:23.670 --> 00:14:27.890
O-Kiku...
I lost everything because of you.

00:14:28.050 --> 00:14:29.970
Don't have a penny to my name.

00:14:30.140 --> 00:14:32.680
You're dying with me!

00:14:37.480 --> 00:14:39.150
Who the hell are you?

00:14:39.310 --> 00:14:41.110
A doctor, so what?

00:14:41.270 --> 00:14:43.150
This is no place for a doctor.

00:14:43.320 --> 00:14:44.740
Stay out of this!

00:14:50.700 --> 00:14:53.330
Bye-bye now.

00:14:58.370 --> 00:15:00.460
T-Tohno-dayu.

00:15:01.420 --> 00:15:04.170
This puppet... Why do you...?

00:15:04.960 --> 00:15:08.630
This is the puppet I made with Dr. Bai Yin
when I was young.

00:15:13.970 --> 00:15:18.310
The memory of the man
dissolved in my blood is reviving.

00:15:20.940 --> 00:15:22.690
You're Shoji...

00:15:23.860 --> 00:15:25.820
You gave us the name of shirogane?

00:15:25.980 --> 00:15:28.490
How do you know that?

00:15:30.110 --> 00:15:32.700
We can talk later, we must get out.

00:15:34.700 --> 00:15:36.830
But before that...

00:15:39.410 --> 00:15:42.960
You got a smudge.
Gotta keep your pretty face pretty.

00:15:45.460 --> 00:15:47.970
Why is it...

00:15:49.010 --> 00:15:52.470
I want to see more of this man's smile.

00:15:56.270 --> 00:15:58.350
We can't pass through here.

00:15:58.560 --> 00:16:00.520
Not even with Arlequin.

00:16:01.020 --> 00:16:03.560
If we give up, it'll be all over.

00:16:03.980 --> 00:16:06.400
There will always be a path forward.

00:16:08.740 --> 00:16:09.860
A path forward...

00:16:14.370 --> 00:16:16.330
I'd been searching for a path.

00:16:17.410 --> 00:16:20.540
No, I'd given up on finding it.

00:16:22.000 --> 00:16:25.090
But now, I have met this man.

00:16:26.460 --> 00:16:30.590
This man is like no other that I've met.

00:16:33.760 --> 00:16:34.970
Arlequin!

00:16:36.140 --> 00:16:37.600
I will open a path.

00:16:37.760 --> 00:16:40.060
Count to 30, then run.

00:16:40.230 --> 00:16:43.310
30? You'll die if you do that!

00:16:43.770 --> 00:16:45.110
Stop!

00:16:46.150 --> 00:16:48.650
I won't die.

00:16:49.150 --> 00:16:52.200
And you will think I'm a monster.

00:16:52.650 --> 00:16:55.660
You will fear me.
And that will be the end.

00:16:55.990 --> 00:16:58.740
Any feelings I have for you
will be in vain.

00:16:58.910 --> 00:17:00.080
Swirling Tiger!

00:17:03.540 --> 00:17:05.830
Yet, I do not mind.

00:17:14.630 --> 00:17:17.550
Because I wish...

00:17:18.010 --> 00:17:20.560
I wish for you to live!

00:18:02.140 --> 00:18:03.060
Forget it all.

00:18:03.980 --> 00:18:09.310
He probably saw me still alive
in the flames and thinks I'm a monster.

00:18:10.770 --> 00:18:14.740
Nobody would drink Aqua Vitae for me.

00:18:21.330 --> 00:18:22.660
How did you find me?

00:18:24.120 --> 00:18:25.750
I heard from Mr. Nakayama.

00:18:26.710 --> 00:18:29.250
But anyways, you idiot!

00:18:29.630 --> 00:18:30.960
You'll catch a cold!

00:18:37.470 --> 00:18:40.800
I'm an unremarkable sort of man.

00:18:41.600 --> 00:18:45.850
I'm over 30, still unmarried,
I don't have any fine hobbies, either.

00:18:46.600 --> 00:18:52.150
But I can listen to you
and get mad and cry with you.

00:18:54.530 --> 00:18:55.490
How about it?

00:18:55.740 --> 00:18:59.160
If there's something weighing you down,
you can tell me.

00:19:00.870 --> 00:19:02.950
No, don't say that...

00:19:03.620 --> 00:19:05.580
You'll make my heart overflow.

00:19:06.450 --> 00:19:08.920
And if it does, I'll be cast away again.

00:19:10.000 --> 00:19:12.000
He'll shove me away.

00:19:13.340 --> 00:19:14.300
No...

00:19:15.050 --> 00:19:16.920
No, Angelina!

00:19:17.260 --> 00:19:18.930
Don't open your heart to him!

00:19:24.640 --> 00:19:26.020
I listened.

00:19:27.180 --> 00:19:28.890
All about her past.

00:19:30.520 --> 00:19:32.940
It was all beyond my imagination.

00:19:38.030 --> 00:19:39.860
So now you know.

00:19:40.360 --> 00:19:43.950
I was cast away by my mother
with just this medicine.

00:19:45.950 --> 00:19:50.040
But I don't wish for anyone
to drink it anymore.

00:19:50.870 --> 00:19:53.920
Nobody should have to bear this curse
besides me.

00:19:55.920 --> 00:19:58.470
Now you've done it.

00:19:59.130 --> 00:20:01.300
What a fool you are, Angelina.

00:20:01.720 --> 00:20:03.640
Now, to face the terrified man.

00:20:04.180 --> 00:20:05.680
And be rejected.

00:20:08.810 --> 00:20:13.020
Your mother cared for you deeply.

00:20:15.020 --> 00:20:16.440
She threw me out!

00:20:16.610 --> 00:20:22.410
She did it on purpose to free you
from a heavy burden.

00:20:23.450 --> 00:20:28.080
The only thing a mother could do
for her immortal offspring,

00:20:28.250 --> 00:20:31.620
was to make sure she had somebody
to walk the path with her.

00:20:33.210 --> 00:20:37.250
But the man who will truly care for her

00:20:37.420 --> 00:20:40.420
will be somebody
she must find for herself.

00:20:40.920 --> 00:20:46.430
Your mother decided to bet on it
and gave you that medicine.

00:20:52.350 --> 00:20:54.440
Mother...

00:20:55.060 --> 00:20:56.270
Understand now?

00:20:57.520 --> 00:20:58.820
Then let's go.

00:21:01.990 --> 00:21:03.240
Where to?

00:21:03.410 --> 00:21:05.780
Your path and mine.

00:21:06.370 --> 00:21:08.290
They are one and the same.

00:21:08.660 --> 00:21:09.830
But...

00:21:10.540 --> 00:21:14.750
You'll walk with me? Don't I scare you?

00:21:15.000 --> 00:21:16.080
I...

00:21:19.670 --> 00:21:21.460
Listen here.

00:21:22.970 --> 00:21:25.300
When Nagasaki men want something
we go for it.

00:21:26.760 --> 00:21:28.510
I know this is a bit late,

00:21:30.060 --> 00:21:31.730
but it was love at first sight.

00:21:32.520 --> 00:21:36.520
Then, you will walk with me?

00:21:36.690 --> 00:21:41.070
Together through eternity?

00:21:41.280 --> 00:21:42.650
Sure thing.

00:21:42.990 --> 00:21:45.780
Even after all of eternity.

00:21:48.070 --> 00:21:52.290
That smile of yours...

00:21:52.450 --> 00:21:55.080
I love it more than anything.

00:21:57.830 --> 00:22:02.090
That man held me as if I were a feather.

00:22:03.510 --> 00:22:05.880
Ever so gently.

00:22:07.390 --> 00:22:08.760
Mother...

00:22:27.660 --> 00:22:31.870
Avoiding the crowds, I walk in the dark

00:22:32.040 --> 00:22:36.870
And wait with bated breath in the wings

00:22:37.040 --> 00:22:41.500
My expression is calm
while I scream inside

00:22:41.670 --> 00:22:46.470
On the verge of being torn apart

00:22:46.630 --> 00:22:51.260
I dance and beckon you to join me

00:22:51.430 --> 00:22:56.140
As a shadow swings across the stage

00:22:56.310 --> 00:22:59.150
I tell myself this is the last time

00:22:59.310 --> 00:23:05.150
But I can't seem to cut myself free

00:23:05.360 --> 00:23:09.700
Too scared to stop for a moment

00:23:09.860 --> 00:23:15.290
My impatience hides
the cries of somebody left behind

00:23:15.620 --> 00:23:23.550
Nobody notices the shadow
standing in the sudden rain

00:23:23.710 --> 00:23:31.640
Somewhere far away,
a memory of you is saying goodbye

00:23:31.800 --> 00:23:39.190
I stand here watching,
no longer able to reach you
